0
//----------------------------------------------------------
// States
// Kanturu walks through these states in turn. The comment at the end of each row names the state.
//   State: 0 None | 1 Battle standby | 2 Battle of Maya | 3 Battle of Nightmare | 4 Tower of Refinement | 5 End
//   Ends by timer: Yes: this step ends by itself after the seconds of the next column. No: it does not run on a timer and goes on when the fight or the objective is completed.
//   Lasts (seconds): Seconds this step lasts. Only used when it ends by timer.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  State    Condition    SetTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0        0            0          // None
    1        0            0          // Battle Standby
    2        0            0          // Battle Of Maya
    3        0            0          // Battle Of NightMare
    4        0            0          // Tower Of Refinement
    5        1            0          // End
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Standby
// Kanturu waits here between cycles and walks through these stages before Maya starts.
//   Stage: The stage of the standby: 0 none, 1 start, 2 notify (the gate to Maya opens), 3 end.
//   Ends by timer: Yes: this step ends by itself after the seconds of the next column. No: it does not run on a timer and goes on when the fight or the objective is completed.
//   Lasts (seconds): Seconds this step lasts. Only used when it ends by timer.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~3]    [Number]     [Number]
//  State    Condition    SetTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0        0            0           // None
    1        1            300         // Start(For Standby time / Event Closed)
    2        1            60          // Notify(For Enter - Gate)
    3        0            0           // End
end

2
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Maya Rounds
// Three rounds against Maya: how long each lasts.
//   Round: The round against Maya: 0, 1 or 2.
//   Ends by timer: Yes: this step ends by itself after the seconds of the next column. No: it does not run on a timer and goes on when the fight or the objective is completed.
//   Lasts (seconds): Seconds this step lasts. Only used when it ends by timer.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~2]    [Number]     [Number]
//  State    Condition    SetTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0        1            900         // First Battle Scene
    1        1            900         // Second Battle Scene
    2        1            1200        // Third Battle Scene
end

3
