//   Stage: The stage of the Tower of Refinement.
//   Ends by timer: Yes: this step ends by itself after the seconds of the next column. No: it does not run on a timer and goes on when the fight or the objective is completed.
//   Lasts (seconds): Seconds this step lasts. Only used when it ends by timer.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~5]    [Number]     [Number]
//  State    Condition    SetTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0        0            0           // None
    1        1            600         // Revitalization(Enter Time)
    2        1            300         // Notify
    3        1            2220        // Close
    4        1            180         // Notify
    5        1            5           // End
end

